type: HeatCrafter
name: "[#97CCE1]Icedaggerium []Nitrogen Extractor"
description: "Extracts nitrogen from the air, requires heat to extract nitrogen."
details: '''
just don't ask where the nitrogen's coming from somewhere like gier, notva or any other planet/asteroid without an atmosphere.
'''
